The injuries sustained by the claimants are as follows:
i) the claimant in CMA.No.958 of 2023 had sustained Polytrauma Left Femur Fracture, Left Grade IIIC Compound Fracture Tibia and Amputation upto knee,
Femur Nailing, for which the Medical Board had assessed the disability at 80%;
ii) the claimant in CMA.No.962 of 2023 had sustained Severe Deformity of the left lower limb and left foot, Comminuted fracture mid diaphysis of left leg femur and Fracture Tibia and fibula of right leg and also post traumatic stiffness of both ankles and shortening of left lower limp and amputation of toes, for which the Medical Board had assessed the disability at 77%;
iii) the claimant in CMA.No.971 of 2023 had sustained Grade IIIb Compound Comminuted Segmental Fracture both bone right leg and Right leg above knee amputated, for which the Medical Board had assessed the disability at 85%;
